# WS2 WP-07 (P4): collection/ equivalents of the signal-lab/ patterns above.
# signal-lab/ patterns are retained until P6 (signal-lab/ still holds workers/
# and if001-full/ until then) — see WS2-MIGRATION-PLAN-R2.md Phase P6.
collection/**/out/
collection/**/*-raw.json
collection/**/*-results.json
collection/**/*-results-v*.json
collection/**/*-summary.json
collection/**/*.jsonl
collection/runs/*/cohort-manifest.json
collection/sources/companies-house/runs/

# ── Repository Governance Rule — operational runtime state (SLG-028) ─────────────
# Authoritative platform artefacts ARE committed (Organisation Registries,
# CAPPED-SIC-CODES.md, manifests, curated/accepted datasets). Operational runtime
# state and non-promoted generated artefacts are reproducible and are NOT committed:
#   • processing ledgers / resume checkpoints / retry / queue / worker state
#   • pilot snapshots and temporary/intermediate acquisition outputs
# Applies to all current and future Population Acquisition runs (FCA, SRA, …).
signal-lab/population-acquisition/runs/*/ledger.ndjson
signal-lab/population-acquisition/runs/*/snapshots/
signal-lab/population-acquisition/runs/*/*.checkpoint
signal-lab/population-acquisition/runs/*/*.checkpoint.*
signal-lab/population-acquisition/runs/*/*.resume
signal-lab/population-acquisition/runs/*/*.tmp
signal-lab/population-acquisition/runs/*/tmp/
